&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Product Marketing Manager, you will have the opportunity to join our fast growing India team and drive the marketing and go-to-market strategy for industry leading services. You will be creating compelling content to help customers, especially platform engineers, and developers understand their use cases and value propositions, and building the right marketing programs to drive awareness, engagement, service adoption, and retention.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits in Bengaluru only.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
