&lt;p&gt;You’ll be architecting the organization, talent, and culture that keeps Everpure simple, sophisticated, and truly transformational at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
