&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;• Frequent interaction with hospitals, skilled nursing facilities, and physician offices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;• Fast-paced, goal-oriented environment focused on referral growth and patient access to care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;• Requires strong time management, organization, and proactive follow-through&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
