&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;FULL TIME, PART TIME &amp;amp; PRN Nursing opportunities!  1st, 2nd and 3rd SHIFTS available. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
