&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; PTO (paid time off)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;401(k) with company match, employer-paid life insurance, employee assistance program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for Our Support Professionals:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One year experience working with intellectual and development disabilities &lt;em&gt;(If you do not have this experience, training is available through our apprentice program)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalent&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
